# setups: HOOK (dawn ridge) · C1 main stage, looks north, target on the RIGHT (all archery) · C2 reverse, looks south at the
# ashram (no archery; sun flips to the left) · SKY (tilt up / arrow follow, same screen direction as C1) · POV (eye window)
# · CU (close-up on a soft backdrop matching its setup) · HOME (girl's room, basket on the RIGHT: rhymes with the bird).
# transitionIn: continuous (same setup, camera moves) · sky-tilt (tilt up into empty sky, come down in the other setup)
# · wipe-by-figure (a foreground prince passes the lens) · iris (eye ↔ POV window) · match (shape/eye match dissolve)
# · ripple (golden rings fill the frame) · dissolve (≤0.5 s). Never a hard cut inside a spoken phrase.
